    "stem": "Evaluate \\(\\lim_{x \\to 1}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{x-1}+\\dfrac{2}{1-x^{2}}\\right]\\)",
    "solution": "\\(\\lim_{x \\to 1}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{x-1}+\\dfrac{2}{(1-x)(x+1)}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 1}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{x-1}-\\dfrac{2}{(x-1)(x+1)}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 1}\\left[\\dfrac{1+x-2}{(x-1)(x+1)}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 1}\\left[\\dfrac{x-1}{(x-1)(x+1)}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 1}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{(x+1)}\\right]\\) ...[As \\(x \\to 1\\), \\(x-1 \\ne 0\\)]\n\\(= \\dfrac{1}{2}\\)"
