    "stem": "Evaluate : \\(\\lim_{x \\to 0}\\left(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x}-1}{x}\\right)\\)",
    "solution": "[Textbook misprint: the label is printed \"Soluton :\" for this example only.]\n\n\\(\\lim_{x \\to 0}\\left(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x}-1}{x}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 0}\\left(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x}-1}{x} \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x}+1}{\\sqrt{1+x}+1}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 0}\\left(\\dfrac{1+x-1}{x\\left(\\sqrt{1+x}+1\\right)}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 0}\\left(\\dfrac{x}{x\\left(\\sqrt{1+x}+1\\right)}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 0}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+x}+1}\\right)\\) ...[As \\(x \\to 0\\), \\(x \\ne 0\\)]\n\\(= \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+0}+1} = \\dfrac{1}{2}\\)",
    "_note": "The book prints the label as \"Soluton :\" (misspelt) for this example only."
  },
