    "stem": "Evaluate \\(\\lim_{z \\to 0}\\left[\\dfrac{(b+z)^{\\frac{1}{2}}-(b-z)^{\\frac{1}{2}}}{z}\\right]\\)",
    "solution": "\\(\\lim_{z \\to 0}\\left[\\dfrac{(b+z)^{\\frac{1}{2}}-(b-z)^{\\frac{1}{2}}}{z}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{z \\to 0}\\left[\\dfrac{\\sqrt{b+z}-\\sqrt{b-z}}{z}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{z \\to 0}\\left[\\dfrac{\\sqrt{b+z}-\\sqrt{b-z}}{z} \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{b+z}+\\sqrt{b-z}}{\\sqrt{b+z}+\\sqrt{b-z}}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{z \\to 0}\\left[\\dfrac{(b+z)-(b-z)}{z} \\times \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{b+z}+\\sqrt{b-z}}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{z \\to 0}\\left[\\dfrac{2z}{z} \\times \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{b+z}+\\sqrt{b-z}}\\right]\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{z \\to 0}\\left[\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{b+z}+\\sqrt{b-z}}\\right]\\) ...[As \\(z \\to 0\\), \\(z \\ne 0\\)]\n\\(= \\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{b+0}+\\sqrt{b-0}}\\)\n\\(= \\dfrac{2}{2\\sqrt{b}}\\)\n\\(= \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{b}}\\)"
  },
