    "solution": "\\(\\lim_{x \\to 4}\\left(\\dfrac{x^{2}+x-20}{\\sqrt{x^{2}-7}-\\sqrt{25-x^{2}}}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 4}\\left(\\dfrac{x^{2}+x-20}{\\sqrt{x^{2}-7}-\\sqrt{25-x^{2}}} \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{x^{2}-7}+\\sqrt{25-x^{2}}}{\\sqrt{x^{2}-7}+\\sqrt{25-x^{2}}}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 4}\\left(\\dfrac{(x-4)(x+5)\\left(\\sqrt{x^{2}-7}+\\sqrt{25-x^{2}}\\right)}{x^{2}-7-25+x^{2}}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 4}\\left(\\dfrac{(x-4)(x+5)\\left(\\sqrt{x^{2}-7}+\\sqrt{25-x^{2}}\\right)}{2\\left(x^{2}-16\\right)}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 4}\\left(\\dfrac{(x-4)(x+5)\\left(\\sqrt{x^{2}-7}+\\sqrt{25-x^{2}}\\right)}{2(x-4)(x+4)}\\right)\\)\n\\(= \\lim_{x \\to 4}\\left(\\dfrac{(x+5)\\left(\\sqrt{x^{2}-7}+\\sqrt{25-x^{2}}\\right)}{2(x+4)}\\right)\\) ...[As \\(x \\to 4\\), \\(x-4 \\ne 0\\)]\n\\(= \\dfrac{(4+5)\\left(\\sqrt{4^{2}-7}+\\sqrt{25-4^{2}}\\right)}{2(4+4)} = \\dfrac{(9)(3+3)}{2(8)} = \\dfrac{27}{8}\\)",
    "_note": "The stem and the first five lines of this solution are printed on p-09 (printed p.142); the working is completed at the top of the left column of p-10 (printed p.143)."
